WEBVTT

00:16.309 --> 00:21.147
Unknown are the names
of the flowers that have been trampled

00:21.356 --> 00:26.611
Birds have fallen to the earth
and long for the wind

00:26.820 --> 00:31.700
Prayers won't solve anything

00:31.908 --> 00:37.038
Only the will to fight
can change the here and now!

00:37.247 --> 00:42.335
O pigs who laugh at the resolve
to walk over corpses to move forward

00:42.544 --> 00:44.879
Livestock complacency? False prosperity?

00:45.088 --> 00:47.757
Give us the freedom of dying,
starving wolves!

00:47.966 --> 00:53.138
The humiliation of being caged
is what triggers us to fight back

00:53.346 --> 00:58.435
We hunters slaughter prey
beyond the castle walls,

00:58.643 --> 01:03.648
consumed with surging bloodlust,

01:03.857 --> 01:10.780
as our crimson bows and arrows
pierce scarlet holes into the twilight

01:38.349 --> 01:39.684
Hey!

01:39.893 --> 01:41.519
Hey! What's wrong, Armin?!

01:41.728 --> 01:42.687
Pull yourself together!

01:42.896 --> 01:43.813
Hey!

01:44.022 --> 01:46.357
Armin! Hey, Armin!

01:46.566 --> 01:47.984
Hey!

01:48.735 --> 01:51.196
You with me?! You okay?!

01:51.404 --> 01:54.365
Are you all right? Where's your squad?

01:54.574 --> 01:56.075
Squad...?

01:56.284 --> 01:57.952
Oh, man. Pull yourself together.

01:58.161 --> 01:59.829
Why are you all by yourself?

02:00.038 --> 02:02.832
Plus you're all wet and slimy...

02:03.041 --> 02:05.168
What the hell happened?

02:10.548 --> 02:13.259
You're so useless! Just die already!

02:13.468 --> 02:15.553
- Whoa! Calm down, Armin!
- Damn it!

02:15.762 --> 02:17.597
Where is everyone?!

02:18.097 --> 02:20.141
Give it a rest, Conny.

02:20.350 --> 02:23.311
They've been wiped out. All but him.

02:23.520 --> 02:26.105
Shut up! Armin hasn't said anything!

02:26.314 --> 02:28.149
Just look around. It's obvious.

02:28.358 --> 02:31.319
We don't got any
more time to waste on him.

02:31.528 --> 02:33.571
Why is he the only one who's okay?!

02:33.780 --> 02:37.242
Beats me. Maybe they
thought he was a corpse?

02:37.450 --> 02:40.537
It sucks that they
ran into multiple Titans

02:40.745 --> 02:42.956
and that only this
underachiever made it out alive.

02:43.164 --> 02:45.124
Eren and the others
worked hard for nothing.

02:45.333 --> 02:47.335
You bitch...

02:47.544 --> 02:49.796
Want me to make it
so you never talk again?!

02:50.004 --> 02:51.381
Stop it, you two!

02:51.589 --> 02:54.008
We're all shaken up here!

02:54.217 --> 02:56.886
All our friends are suddenly
dying left and right!

02:57.095 --> 02:58.346
It's natural we're upset!

02:58.555 --> 03:04.102
That's my Christa!
Marry me when this is over!

03:04.310 --> 03:05.728
Yeah...

03:06.271 --> 03:08.731
She is clowning
around more than usual.

03:09.482 --> 03:11.317
Anyways, we can't stay here.

03:11.526 --> 03:13.570
Can you stand, Armin?!

03:17.240 --> 03:20.034
I'm sorry for the trouble.

03:21.035 --> 03:23.037
I'll rendezvous with the rearguard.

03:23.246 --> 03:23.955
Hey...

03:24.163 --> 03:25.582
Armin!

03:29.210 --> 03:33.047
Let's go, Conny!
We've been ordered to advance!

03:37.468 --> 03:39.345
This is hell...

03:39.554 --> 03:43.766
No, it hasn't become hell.

03:43.975 --> 03:47.270
I was just mistaken until now.

03:47.478 --> 03:51.608
This world has always been hell,
from the very start.

03:53.484 --> 03:56.613
The strong prey on the weak.

03:56.821 --> 03:59.991
It's such a simple,
straightforward world.

04:01.034 --> 04:03.995
It's just, my friends...

04:06.831 --> 04:11.127
They tried to be strong in this world.

04:12.629 --> 04:16.549
They helped me, someone who was weak.

04:16.758 --> 04:20.136
I couldn't bear it...

04:20.345 --> 04:24.682
They saw me as someone
who needed to be protected.

04:24.891 --> 04:27.060
I wanted to live
in this world like them...

04:27.268 --> 04:33.399
I wanted to be strong and stand
shoulder-to-shoulder with them...

04:41.699 --> 04:44.285
And this is the result.

04:44.494 --> 04:47.413
Because of me, Eren wound up...

04:59.258 --> 05:00.385
Hanna...

05:00.593 --> 05:02.637
What are you doing?

05:02.845 --> 05:03.930
Armin! Help!

05:04.138 --> 05:06.599
Franz isn't breathing!

05:06.808 --> 05:12.355
I've tried resuscitating him
over and over and over...

05:13.064 --> 05:14.899
...but it's not working!

05:15.108 --> 05:17.402
It's dangerous down here, Hanna.

05:17.610 --> 05:21.489
- You need to get on a roof...
- I can't just leave Franz like this!

05:21.698 --> 05:24.742
You don't understand, Hanna...

05:24.951 --> 05:26.577
Franz is...

05:33.751 --> 05:37.755
Please... stop this...

05:38.506 --> 05:39.716
I...

05:41.843 --> 05:45.096
I can't take this anymore...

05:45.304 --> 05:47.015
I can't...

05:52.311 --> 05:57.150
H-Hey, now! Don't you guys
realize how bad the situation is?!

05:57.358 --> 05:59.819
Yeah! That's why we're doin' this!

06:00.028 --> 06:02.280
And if you guys wanna live,
you'll give us some damn help!

06:02.488 --> 06:04.282
- The hell with that!
- It's gonna get stuck!

06:04.490 --> 06:07.493
- Letting people through comes first!
- We're all gonna get eaten standing here!

06:07.702 --> 06:10.955
- What are you doing, soldier?!
- Go get 'em!

06:11.164 --> 06:12.540
B-But...

06:12.749 --> 06:17.128
Just try it, small fry! I'm the boss
of this town's merchant association!

06:17.336 --> 06:19.255
Uhh, err...

06:19.464 --> 06:23.593
Who do you think pays for
the meals you soldiers shit out?!

06:23.801 --> 06:27.263
Do you have the money to
provide for the soldiers in this town?!

06:27.472 --> 06:28.931
Push, all of you!

06:29.140 --> 06:34.187
This cargo's worth more than you
can earn in your entire measly lives!

06:34.395 --> 06:36.814
Help, and you'll be rewarded!

06:37.023 --> 06:38.357
It'll be okay.

06:38.566 --> 06:42.695
Your dad's going to use his
cannons to make the Titans go away.

06:42.904 --> 06:44.614
Mom.

06:44.822 --> 06:46.449
Over there.

06:57.168 --> 06:58.377
Push!

06:58.586 --> 07:00.463
Push if you don't wanna die!

07:00.671 --> 07:02.298
Stop! The children...!

07:07.220 --> 07:09.722
Damn! Why is it ignoring us?!

07:09.931 --> 07:12.391
It's an Abnormal!
No point trying to figure it out!

07:12.600 --> 07:15.812
It's fast! Not even we
elites can catch up to it!

07:16.020 --> 07:17.855
At this rate...!

07:37.834 --> 07:40.461
What... are you doing?

07:40.670 --> 07:42.547
Oh, perfect timing!

07:42.755 --> 07:45.383
Get these guys to help me!

07:45.591 --> 07:48.010
I'll make it worth your while!

07:49.887 --> 07:53.683
My comrades are dying as we speak.

07:53.891 --> 07:59.564
They're fighting and dying because
the citizens haven't finished evacuating.

07:59.772 --> 08:01.065
Of course they are!

08:01.274 --> 08:03.401
It's your duty to give your hearts

08:03.609 --> 08:06.445
to defend the lives
and property of the people!

08:06.654 --> 08:09.365
Don't go gettin' a big head now
that you freeloaders have somethin' to do

08:09.574 --> 08:11.409
after a century of uselessness!

08:20.084 --> 08:23.754
If you feel people dying for
other people is a matter of course,

08:23.963 --> 08:29.552
then I'm sure you'll understand
that a single, precious life

08:29.760 --> 08:32.180
can sometimes save
the lives of many as well.

08:32.388 --> 08:33.806
Just you try it!

08:34.015 --> 08:36.517
Your employer and I go way back!

08:36.726 --> 08:41.731
One word from me and
he'll be all over your sorry ass!

08:45.484 --> 08:47.486
How can a dead body talk?

08:50.323 --> 08:51.741
Wait!

08:55.536 --> 08:58.206
S-Sir!

08:58.414 --> 09:00.249
Pull the cart out.

09:09.175 --> 09:11.385
Thanks, lady!

09:11.594 --> 09:15.765
You really saved the day.
You have our gratitude!

09:41.374 --> 09:44.627
Good work taking it down,
Ackermann. Very impressive.

09:44.835 --> 09:48.005
Thank you, Sir. However...

09:48.214 --> 09:52.510
I'm afraid I inadvertently dulled
my blades during the attack.

09:52.718 --> 09:54.929
I will be more careful next time.

09:55.930 --> 09:59.350
Just what have
you had to live through...?

09:59.558 --> 10:01.560
No, never mind.

10:07.483 --> 10:10.987
Why am I reminded
of it at a time like this?

10:29.505 --> 10:31.132
Finished!

10:31.340 --> 10:32.883
Look, Mom!

10:33.092 --> 10:35.928
Oh, you did a great job, Mikasa!

10:36.137 --> 10:37.972
It's very nice!

10:39.015 --> 10:41.225
This style of embroidery has
been passed down in our clan

10:41.434 --> 10:43.769
from generation to generation.

10:43.978 --> 10:47.315
When you have a child,
it'll be your turn to pass it on too!

10:48.566 --> 10:50.443
How can I have a child?

10:50.651 --> 10:54.113
Err, why don't you ask your father that?

10:54.322 --> 10:55.614
Well, Dad?

10:55.823 --> 10:58.784
Oh, uhh, I don't really know, either!

10:58.993 --> 11:01.704
Oh, I know!
Dr. Jaeger will be here any minute!

11:01.912 --> 11:04.248
Why don't we ask him?

11:06.876 --> 11:09.837
Oh, that must be him!

11:12.381 --> 11:13.799
Coming!

11:19.180 --> 11:19.972
Mikasa?

11:20.181 --> 11:23.809
Yes. She's about your age.

11:24.018 --> 11:28.147
There aren't many children
in these parts, so try to get along.

11:28.356 --> 11:30.858
That depends on how she acts...

11:31.067 --> 11:32.360
Eren.

11:32.568 --> 11:35.863
That attitude is why
you've only made one friend.

11:37.365 --> 11:38.949
Are they not home?

11:40.034 --> 11:41.118
Mr. Ackermann!

11:41.327 --> 11:43.162
It's Jaeger!

11:45.498 --> 11:47.333
Is anyone home?

11:49.627 --> 11:51.128
What's wrong?

11:52.588 --> 11:54.548
What is it, Dad?

12:03.015 --> 12:04.308
Too late.

12:04.517 --> 12:05.601
Eren.

12:05.810 --> 12:10.106
Have you seen the girl..
Mikasa... anywhere nearby?

12:10.314 --> 12:11.649
No.

12:11.857 --> 12:13.275
I see...

12:14.485 --> 12:17.655
I'll get the Military Police
and have them conduct a search!

12:17.863 --> 12:19.698
You'll wait at the foot of the mountain.

12:19.907 --> 12:22.410
Is that clear, Eren?!

12:23.536 --> 12:24.954
Eren!

12:31.460 --> 12:35.881
Hey. Are you sure she'll actually sell?

12:36.090 --> 12:39.009
We even went and killed her
parents before running off with her...

12:39.218 --> 12:42.138
Take a look at her face.

12:43.722 --> 12:48.060
Looks nice, but she's
still just a kid. She ain't for me.

12:48.269 --> 12:50.855
I'm not asking about your tastes.

12:51.063 --> 12:53.107
She's an "Oriental."

12:53.315 --> 12:56.485
There used to be different types
of humans, you see.

12:56.694 --> 12:59.029
Long ago, some people
fled a place called the Orient

12:59.238 --> 13:01.031
and sought refuge inside the walls.

13:01.240 --> 13:03.784
She's the last descendant of that clan.

13:03.993 --> 13:06.537
We're gonna take her to the
underground market in the capital

13:06.745 --> 13:09.540
and auction her off to those old perverts.

13:09.748 --> 13:13.878
All the other Orientals have died out,
so she'll go for a pretty hefty price.

13:14.086 --> 13:17.423
Her old man didn't
look like an Oriental to me.

13:17.631 --> 13:19.383
She ain't pureblooded.

13:20.593 --> 13:23.762
That's right! The mom
was the really valuable one!

13:23.971 --> 13:25.598
But you had to freak out and kill her!

13:25.806 --> 13:28.642
I-I couldn't help it! She put up a fight!

13:28.851 --> 13:31.604
That all you got
to say for yourself?! Huh?!

13:37.109 --> 13:37.985
Dr. Jaeger!

13:38.194 --> 13:40.029
We've been expecting...

13:52.833 --> 13:54.835
Hello. Pardon the intrusion.

14:00.925 --> 14:02.843
Just take it nice and easy,

14:03.052 --> 14:06.430
unless you want
your head split open with this.

14:08.516 --> 14:09.725
This broad's crazy!

14:09.934 --> 14:11.435
Mikasa! Run!

14:11.644 --> 14:13.103
Huh? M-Mom...

14:13.312 --> 14:15.231
Hurry, Mikasa!

14:16.148 --> 14:18.150
Uhh...

14:18.359 --> 14:19.401
Dad...?

14:19.610 --> 14:22.696
Damn it! I've had enough of your crap!

14:35.459 --> 14:38.420
What the hell?!
I said only kill the dad!

14:38.629 --> 14:40.798
Don't look at me!
She's the one who...!

14:41.006 --> 14:43.217
Save your excuses! Go get the kid!

14:43.425 --> 14:44.843
Huh?!

14:47.555 --> 14:48.389
Hey.

14:48.597 --> 14:50.891
You better behave yourself.

14:52.184 --> 14:54.979
Or else... this!

15:06.031 --> 15:07.449
Cold...

15:18.460 --> 15:20.462
Excuse me...

15:21.297 --> 15:22.715
Hold it, kid!

15:22.923 --> 15:25.050
How did you find this place?!

15:25.259 --> 15:26.844
Err, uhh...

15:27.052 --> 15:32.308
I got lost in the forest,
and then, umm, I saw a cabin, so...

15:37.021 --> 15:41.567
You know kids shouldn't
wander around the forest all alone.

15:41.775 --> 15:45.321
Scary wolves live
in the forest, you know.

15:45.529 --> 15:47.948
But there's nothing to
worry about now.

15:48.157 --> 15:50.659
We'll be happy to take you...

15:52.369 --> 15:54.455
Thanks, Mister.

15:54.663 --> 15:56.957
I already know the score.

15:57.916 --> 16:00.919
So die, you asshole!

16:03.088 --> 16:06.842
Huh?! What the hell?!

16:07.051 --> 16:10.095
G-Get back here, kid!

16:16.226 --> 16:18.604
You damn animal...!

16:18.812 --> 16:21.106
Die! Die!

16:21.315 --> 16:25.903
This is what you get!
This is what you deserve!

16:26.111 --> 16:29.490
Never get up again!

16:44.338 --> 16:48.842
You're safe now...
You can relax.

16:51.637 --> 16:54.056
I take it you're Mikasa?

16:54.264 --> 16:55.557
I'm Eren.

16:55.766 --> 17:00.896
I'm Dr. Jaeger's son.
I'm sure you've met my dad before.

17:01.105 --> 17:04.274
I was tagging along when he
visited your house for a checkup.

17:04.483 --> 17:06.110
But then...

17:08.737 --> 17:10.948
There were three of them.

17:20.958 --> 17:22.584
Was it you?

17:25.796 --> 17:27.172
Was it you who killed 'em?!

17:27.381 --> 17:28.966
Was it?!

17:29.174 --> 17:32.886
I'm gonna kill you!
I'm gonna kill you!

17:33.095 --> 17:35.806
F-Fight!

17:36.014 --> 17:37.850
Fight!

17:38.058 --> 17:41.645
Fight... or die...!

17:41.854 --> 17:44.064
Win... and live!

17:44.273 --> 17:47.276
What the hell are you thinking, brat?!

17:47.484 --> 17:51.029
The only way to win...
is to fight!

17:56.535 --> 17:58.829
No... I can't do it!

18:07.546 --> 18:11.425
Just then... I remembered.

18:11.633 --> 18:14.303
I had seen this same thing...

18:14.511 --> 18:17.431
...over and over...

18:17.639 --> 18:19.516
...all my life.

18:21.393 --> 18:25.397
I'd seen it everywhere I went...

18:25.606 --> 18:27.024
But...

18:27.858 --> 18:30.569
I always looked the other way.

18:33.030 --> 18:34.448
"That's right...

18:36.366 --> 18:37.993
We live...

18:39.828 --> 18:41.830
...in a cruel world."

18:50.088 --> 18:54.384
At that moment,
my body stopped shaking.

18:54.593 --> 18:59.515
I was in full control of
myself after that.

19:01.058 --> 19:03.769
I thought I could do anything...

19:03.977 --> 19:05.395
"Fight."

19:10.192 --> 19:11.610
"Fight!"

19:12.486 --> 19:13.904
"Fight!"

19:24.498 --> 19:27.709
Stabbed through the heart from behind.

19:27.918 --> 19:30.629
Those kids did this?

19:35.676 --> 19:39.304
Eren. I told you to wait
at the foot of the mountain.

19:39.513 --> 19:42.766
Do you have any idea what you've done?!

19:42.975 --> 19:45.269
I got rid of some dangerous animals!

19:45.477 --> 19:48.230
They just happened to look like people!

19:48.438 --> 19:49.690
Eren!

19:49.898 --> 19:53.944
They would've been long gone
by the time the Military Police arrived!

19:54.152 --> 19:55.571
It would've been too late!

19:55.779 --> 20:00.534
Even so, you were just lucky, Eren!

20:00.742 --> 20:05.873
The way you casually threw
your life away is what I'm angry about!

20:06.081 --> 20:07.958
But...

20:08.166 --> 20:11.378
I wanted to save her as fast as I could...

20:15.090 --> 20:18.552
Mikasa. Do you remember me?

20:18.760 --> 20:22.180
We've met several times before,
when you were little.

20:24.641 --> 20:26.727
Dr. Jaeger...

20:26.935 --> 20:32.149
How do I get home from here?

20:33.775 --> 20:36.111
I'm cold...

20:36.320 --> 20:41.116
I have nowhere to go now...

20:51.793 --> 20:53.795
You can keep this.

20:57.257 --> 20:59.343
Warm, isn't it?

21:05.182 --> 21:07.643
It is...

21:07.851 --> 21:08.977
Mikasa.

21:09.186 --> 21:11.313
Come live with us.

21:11.521 --> 21:13.065
Huh?

21:13.273 --> 21:16.443
You've been through a lot.

21:16.652 --> 21:20.113
You need plenty of rest.

21:22.199 --> 21:23.742
What is it?

21:23.951 --> 21:27.204
C'mon. Let's go already.

21:27.412 --> 21:29.373
To our home.

21:33.585 --> 21:35.420
Yeah. Let's go...

21:50.435 --> 21:55.273
A cruel world in which only
the victors are allowed to live...

21:59.945 --> 22:01.113
Time to withdraw, Ackermann!

22:01.321 --> 22:02.656
Let's scale the wall!

22:02.864 --> 22:04.908
I'll go assist the vanguard's retreat!

22:05.117 --> 22:07.202
H-Hey, Ackermann!

22:07.411 --> 22:11.999
But I do have a place to
call home in this world now.

22:13.959 --> 22:15.210
Eren.

22:15.419 --> 22:19.423
As long as I have you,
I can do anything.

22:37.482 --> 22:42.404
Your dreams are where your heart is

22:42.612 --> 22:48.660
They're more fragile than life itself

22:48.869 --> 22:53.331
Over and over you cast them aside,
only to find more

22:53.540 --> 23:00.005
Now, rest in peace

23:00.213 --> 23:11.349
Pounding impulses defile the things we wish for

23:11.558 --> 23:21.610
and the more we forget
the more we remember again

23:21.818 --> 23:27.574
In this beautiful, cruel world

23:27.783 --> 23:32.746
all I can do is ask why we're still alive

23:32.954 --> 23:38.460
Oh, with our strength... and our weakness...

23:38.668 --> 23:44.132
what are we going to protect if there's no sense

23:44.341 --> 23:47.761
to anything anymore?

23:54.935 --> 23:58.480
"I have a place to call home."

23:58.688 --> 24:02.943
After finishing her rearguard duties,
Mikasa hurries to see Eren,

24:03.151 --> 24:07.155
only to learn of his death.
